Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 11:34:49 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] hardware/xiaomi: complete dual ALS fusion handling

Preserve fused ALS activation, batching, flush, event ordering, and queue behavior across both physical sensors.

diff --git a/aidl/sensors/HalProxy.cpp b/aidl/sensors/HalProxy.cpp
index 92633c0..4cd3de9 100644
